  "body": "Location, location, location! Build your dream home here! Zoned Residential - Mixed Housing Suburban, this 1788m2 property has great development potential with the section having an approximate 7 metre gradient and stormwater line on site. \r\nThere's currently a 1940's 3 bedroom, 1 bathroom character bungalow for removal or potential to renovate back to its former glory.\r\n\r\nAwesome location - it doesn't get much better than this! Located in the highly sought after coastal suburb of Torbay known for its relaxed seaside lifestyle and family-friendly community. The property is approximately 100 metres to Rock Isle Bay and Waiake Beach and walking distance to Torbay Village. Close to Long Bay, Browns Bay, an easy commute to the Albany business district and the motorway and zoned for Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nIdeal for a very generous seaside home of your own, several multi-generational family homes or a multi development site. Families looking for a special place to build your dream home, builders and developers must view!  \r\n\r\nlink to download Harcourt property files https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/GSHF",
